    /// This conversation's own settings, as the app shows them to a member: name, avatar, kind, member count, your role, public username (handle — null for a link-only group, entered only through its invite link, D-167), search visibility, retention (disappearing-message timer, keep-forever), the pinned message, and whether an invite link exists. The invite link itself is included only when your role is admin or owner.
